## Module Responsibilities

| Module | Responsibility | Key Files |
|--------|---------------|-----------|
| **pages/** | Route rendering, user interaction | 12 pages |
| **components/review/** | 5 challenge types for Arena | ArenaShell, ChallengeManager, *_Challenge.tsx |
| **contexts/** | Global state (auth, roadmap, sidebar) | AuthContext, RoadmapContext, SidebarContext |
| **hooks/** | Stateful logic (flashcard, review session) | useFlashcard, useReviewSession, useFreeStudySession |
| **lib/storage/** | Supabase data fetching + caching | auth, mastery, roadmap, session |
| **lib/admin-queries.ts** | Admin panel CRUD (direct writes) | admin-queries.ts |
| **lib/challenge-logic.ts** | SHARED — quadrant selection | Extracted from both hooks |
| **lib/srs.ts** | FSRS algorithm + SM-2 migration | CardProgress, calculateFSRSReview, isMastered |
| **lib/streak.ts** | Streak tracking (localStorage + Supabase) | loadStreak, fetchStreakFromSupabase, recordStudy |

## Data Flow: Initial App Load

```
1. App mount → AuthContext.init()
2. AuthContext → supabase.auth.getSession()
3. If logged in → fetchInitialAppData(userId)
   → RPC: get_initial_app_data(userId)
   ← Returns: { profile, stats, health, active_roadmap }
4. AuthContext stores initialData → all pages read via useAuth()
5. Per-page: fetch additional data via lib/storage/*
```

## RPC Endpoints (Supabase)

| RPC | Returns |
|-----|---------|
| `get_initial_app_data` | profile, stats, health (retention, stability, forecast) |
| `get_progress_page_data` | memory_health, roadmap_progress, overall_stats |
| `get_topic_completion_map` | { topicId: { total, learned, percent } } |

